<title>UK: Baltic freight index fell 16 to 1,345.</title>
<headline>Baltic freight index fell 16 to 1,345.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, April 18, Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,345 today from 1,361 on April 17, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates</p>
<p>in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1356    12.306	  1378    12.506</p>
<p>   1a   1372 10394.000	  1390 10252.000</p>
<p>   2    1575    22.500	  1582    22.594</p>
<p>   2a   1579 13094.000	  1619 13281.000</p>
<p>   3    1496    13.806	  1534    14.156</p>
<p>   3a   1353 10675.000	  1378 10875.000</p>
<p>   6    1226    12.650	  1228    12.669</p>
